    "Violines reales con arco suave, en su registro natural, evocan agua corriente. Cerca de cero el motivo es más estable; al crecer la magnitud de la anomalía aparecen tensión y discontinuidades graduales. Son gestos originales: el mapa muestra temperatura, no caudales.": "Real violin recordings, gently bowed in their natural register, evoke flowing water. Near zero, the motif is more stable; as the anomaly grows in magnitude, tension and breaks in continuity gradually emerge. These are original musical gestures: the map shows temperature, not water flow.",
