    "Wagner · Murmullos del bosque": "Wagner · Forest Murmurs",
    "Violín auténtico con sordina de Rena Ishii, publicado por Ivica Bukvic, junto a flauta y clarinete grabados. El motivo original pasa de mayor estabilidad a tensión y fragmentación progresivas, como metáfora del paisaje. El mapa no mide pérdida de bosque.": "An authentic muted violin recording by Rena Ishii, released by Ivica Bukvic, is joined by recorded flute and clarinet. The original motif moves from greater stability toward increasing tension and fragmentation as a metaphor for the landscape. The map does not measure forest loss.",
